S573 sharpened dual Burnside constraints for LRC
==============================================================================
grid N=38640; threshold=1/14
Universal constraint: 1_X(t)=1_X(-t).  The legal stabilizer is
dihedral: cyclic folds plus their reflection cosets.
Dual constraint: the lonely word has zero odd/sine sector.

